lex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 text-xs tabular-nums text-text-secondary"><span>Jun 30, 2026</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>1<!-- --> <!-- -->page</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>54 B</span></span></span></a></li></ul></div></div></section></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_sav5ubsivb_-trigger-votes" id="radix-_R_sav5ubsivb_-content-votes" tabindex="0" class="mt-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-[1.5px] focus-visible:ring-focus focus-visible:ring-offset-2 ring-offset-white pt-4 data-[state=inactive]:hidden print:block!"><h2 class="sr-only print:not-sr-only print:mb-3 print:text-lg print:font-semibold">Votes</h2><div class="space-y-6"><section aria-label="Council meeting of June 30, 2026"><div class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-primary">Council meeting of June 30, 2026</h3><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-interactive hover:underline" href="/meetings/2026-06-30-council"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-days h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path><path d="M8 14h.01"></path><path d="M12 14h.01"></path><path d="M16 14h.01"></path><path d="M8 18h.01"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M16 18h.01"></path></svg>View meeting</a></div><div class="space-y-2"><div data-state="closed" class="group/vote overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-primary-100 bg-white"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 pr-3"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_r9sav5ubsivb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items