UEECE HARRIS-DAWSON</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">EUNISSES HERNANDEZ</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">HEATHER HUTT</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">YSABEL JURADO</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">JOHN S. LEE</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">TIM MCOSKER</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">ADRIN NAZARIAN</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">IMELDA PADILLA</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">TRACI PARK</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">CURREN D. PRICE, JR.</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-gray-100 text-gray-700">Absent</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">NITHYA RAMAN</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">MONICA RODRIGUEZ</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">HUGO SOTO­-MARTÍNEZ</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li><li class="flex break-inside-avoid items-center justify-between gap-3 py-0.5"><span translate="no" class="notranslate min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-primary">KATY YAROSLAVSKY</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-900">Yes</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_sav5ubsivb_-trigger-comments" id="radix-_R_sav5ubsivb_-content-comments" tabindex="0" class="mt-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-[1.5px] focus-visible:ring-focus focus-visible:ring-offset-2 ring-offset-white pt-4 data-[state=inactive]:hidden print:block!"><h2 class="sr-only print:not-sr-only print:mb-3 print:text-lg print:font-semibold">Comments</h2><div class="space-y-6"><div><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Written comments on this Council File are collected and posted here twice each business day. Individual comments are not shown live.</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-secondary">You can also email your comment to<!-- --> <a class="rounded text-interactive hover:underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-[1.5px] focus-visible:ring-focus" href="mailto:LACityClerk.LMS@lacity.org">LACityClerk.LMS@lacity.org</a>. PDF attachments sent by email are posted with the comment after a safety check (up to 5 PDFs, 25 MB each; the whole email must be under 40 MB). Other attachments are not posted.</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-secondary">Fill out the form below, or<!-- --> <a data-usage="comment_open" class="rounded text-interactive hover:underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-[1.5px] focus-visible:ring-focus" href="/comment?cf=26-1100-S19">use the standalone comment page</a>.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-white p-5"><p role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></p><h3 tabindex="-1" class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-primary focus:outline-none">Submit a written comment</h3><form noValidate="" class="mt-4 space-y-4"><p class="text-xs text-text-secondary">Fields marked * are required.</p><div><span class="block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-secondary">Council file</span><span class="mt-0.5 block text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text-primary">26-1100-S19</span></div><div><label for="_R_5bsav5ubsivb_-name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-text-primary">Name<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-0.5 text-error">*</span><span class="sr-only"> (required)</span></label><input class="flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border border-border bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-900 transition-[border-color,box-shadow] hover:shadow-[0_0_0_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium placeholder:text-gray-500 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-[1.5px] focus-visible:ring-focus focus-visible:ring-offset-2 ring-offset-white focus-visible:shadow-none aria-invalid:border-error aria-invalid:hover:shadow-[0_0_0_2px_rgba(239,68,68,0.08)] aria-invalid:focus-visible:ring-error aria-invalid:focus-visible:border-border disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 disabled:hover:shadow-none mt-1" id="_R_5bsav5ubsivb_-name" required="" autoComplete="name" value=""/></div><div><label for="_R_5bsav5ubsivb_-email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-text-primary">Email<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-0.5 text-error">*</span><span class="sr-only"> (required)</span></label><input type="email" class="flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border border-border bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-900 transition-[border-color,box-shadow] hover:shadow-[0_0_0_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-med